    {
      "id": "claim_7ac428c79dd64e71a2fcf0eaa9a19cea",
      "statement": "ValidateCustomProviderID rejects an id that is empty, longer than 64 characters, contains characters other than lowercase letters/digits/dot/underscore/hyphen, or matches IsReservedProviderID, which is the set of built-in provider ids plus the extra reserved id \"shell\" (reserved even though it is not a built-in provider) because the wrapper's dispatch has a dedicated \"shell\" branch that would silently swallow a custom provider's Command if a custom entry could claim that id.",
